@startuml DIAGRAM_05A_VIVA_EXAM
'==============================================================
' AIVES - LIVE VIVA EXAM (slide-ready, Vietnamese)
' Style modelled on the Visual Paradigm look used by the reference:
'   - participant box: light blue fill, blue border, blue bold text
'   - life line: THIN DASHED vertical guide (kept dashed on purpose)
'   - messages: numbered "1:", "2:", ... solid = call, dashed = return
'
' Thành phần: Sinh viên . Web App . Backend API . DB . Cloudflare R2 . AI Engine
'
' Đối chiếu với:
'   frontend/aives-web/src/lib/media/chunkedUploader.ts
'   backend/Aives.Api/Controllers/ChunkedAudioController.cs
'   backend/Aives.Application/Viva/Services/VivaSessionService.cs
'   ai-service/app/api/{speech,interview}.py
'
'   Sau khi render, chạy:
'     python ops/_sharpen_svg.py DIAGRAM_05A_VIVA_EXAM.svg --dashed-lifelines
'==============================================================
title Live Viva Exam (AIVES)

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam defaultFontColor #000000
skinparam BoxPadding 8

'--- participant / actor boxes: light blue like VP ---
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #DAE8FC
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #4A7EBB
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderThickness 1.6
skinparam sequenceParticipantFontColor #1F3864
skinparam sequenceParticipantFontStyle bold
skinparam sequenceParticipantFontSize 15

skinparam sequenceActorBackgroundColor #DAE8FC
skinparam sequenceActorBorderColor #4A7EBB
skinparam sequenceActorBorderThickness 1.6
skinparam sequenceActorFontColor #1F3864
skinparam sequenceActorFontStyle bold
skinparam sequenceActorFontSize 15

skinparam sequenceDatabaseBackgroundColor #DAE8FC
skinparam sequenceDatabaseBorderColor #4A7EBB
skinparam sequenceDatabaseBorderThickness 1.6
skinparam sequenceDatabaseFontColor #1F3864
skinparam sequenceDatabaseFontStyle bold
skinparam sequenceDatabaseFontSize 14

'--- life lines: thin dashed guide ---
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #6C8EBF
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderThickness 1.4
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBackgroundColor #FFFFFF

'--- arrows: dark, call = solid, return = dashed ---
skinparam sequenceArrowColor #333333
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.6

skinparam sequenceNoteBorderColor #4A7EBB
skinparam sequenceNoteBackgroundColor #DAE8FC
skinparam sequenceNoteBorderThickness 1.4
skinparam sequenceNoteFontColor #1F3864
skinparam sequenceNoteFontSize 13

skinparam sequenceGroupBorderColor #4A7EBB
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderThickness 1.4
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor #F4F8FD
skinparam sequenceGroupFontColor #1F3864
skinparam sequenceGroupFontSize 13

skinparam sequenceDividerBackgroundColor #4A7EBB
skinparam sequenceDividerFontColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequenceDividerFontSize 13

skinparam titleFontSize 20
skinparam titleFontStyle bold
skinparam titleFontColor #1F3864

actor "Sinh viên" as Student
participant "Web App" as Web
participant "Backend API\nASP.NET Core" as BE
database "DB" as DB
participant "Cloudflare R2" as R2
participant "AI Engine\nFastAPI" as AI

== Bắt đầu ca thi ==

Student -> Web: 1: Mở phòng thi
Web -> BE: 2: Bắt đầu session
BE -> DB: 3: Lấy session + enrollment
DB --> BE: 4: Session + câu hỏi đầu tiên
BE --> Web: 5: Câu hỏi đầu tiên
Web --> Student: 6: Hiển thị câu hỏi

== Trả lời (lặp lại mỗi câu) ==

Student -> Web: 7: Ghi âm câu trả lời
Web -> BE: 8: Khởi tạo upload chunked
BE --> Web: 9: uploadId
Web -> BE: 10: Upload các chunk audio
BE -> R2: 11: Lưu object audio
BE --> Web: 12: Upload hoàn tất (objectKey)
Web -> BE: 13: Nộp câu trả lời (uploadId)
BE -> AI: 14: Chuyển giọng nói + sinh câu hỏi tiếp theo
AI --> BE: 15: Transcript + câu hỏi tiếp theo
BE -> DB: 16: Lưu câu trả lời (PROCESSING) + result (PENDING_REVIEW)
BE --> Web: 17: Feedback + câu hỏi tiếp theo
Web --> Student: 18: Hiển thị feedback + câu hỏi tiếp theo

note over BE,AI
  Giao thức nội bộ Backend - AI:
  - POST /ai/speech/transcribe-object
    (AI tự kéo audio từ R2)
  - POST /ai/interview/follow-up
  - Header X-Internal-Token
    (= AI_SERVICE_SECRET_KEY)
  - Base URL http://ai-service:8000
  - Timeout 300s
end note

== Kết thúc ==

Student -> Web: 19: Kết thúc bài thi
Web -> BE: 20: Finish session
BE -> DB: 21: Status = COMPLETED + xếp hàng job chấm điểm
BE --> Web: 22: Đã nộp bài
Web --> Student: 23: Đã nộp bài

note over AI, R2
  AI có thể hỏi follow-up sau mỗi câu trả lời,
  tuỳ theo rubric của ca thi.
end note

@enduml
